{"id":"buildpacks","title":"4. Multi-Buildpack Mechanism","phase":null,"phaseName":null,"category":"Documentation","subcategory":"buildpacks","language":"markdown","description":"","sections":[],"content":"<h2>The Two Buildpacks</h2><p>1. <strong>Node.js Buildpack</strong> (SAP BTP standard)<br>   - Detects presence of <code>package.json</code><br>   - Installs Node.js runtime (LTS version)<br>   - Runs <code>npm install</code><br>   - Executes start command (<code>npm start</code> or <code>node server.js</code>)<br>   - Exposes app on <code>$PORT</code> (default 8080)</p><p>2. <strong>Python Buildpack</strong> (SAP BTP standard)<br>   - Detects presence of <code>requirements.txt</code> or <code>setup.py</code><br>   - Installs Python runtime<br>   - Runs <code>pip install -r requirements.txt</code><br>   - Executes the Python entrypoint</p><h2>The Multi Buildpack Mechanism</h2><p>In <code>manifest.yml</code>, the <code>buildpacks</code> array specifies multiple buildpacks. The BTP deployment engine runs them <strong>sequentially</strong>:</p><pre><code class=\"language-yaml\"># manifest.yml - Multi-Buildpack Configuration\napplications:\n  - name: bookshop-multi-buildpack\n    memory: 512M\n    buildpacks:\n      - python_buildpack\n      - nodejs_buildpack\n    command: npm start\n    routes:\n      - route: bookshop-multi-buildpack.cfapps.us10-003.hana.ondemand.com\n    env:\n      PYTHON_BIN: python3\n      NODE_ENV: production\n      AI_MODEL: meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct\n      AI_TIMEOUT: &quot;900&quot;\n    services:\n      - bookshop-multi-buildpack-db\n      - destination-service\n      - bookshop-multi-buildpack-uaa</code></pre><p>Each buildpack contributes its runtime layer to the final <strong>Droplet</strong> (container image). The droplet contains:<br><ul><li>Linux base (Ubuntu/Debian)</li><br><li>Node.js binaries + npm packages</li><br><li>Python interpreter + pip packages</li><br><li>Application source code</li><br><li>Start script</li><br></ul><br><h2>How the Startup Works</h2><h3>The Role of server.js</h3><p>The <code>server.js</code> file is <strong>the critical orchestrator</strong> that makes Multi Buildpack work. Without it, the application would fail to start because:</p><p>1. <strong>Single Entrypoint Problem</strong>: Cloud Foundry expects one start command. Node.js is the primary runtime (first buildpack), so its start script runs.</p><p>2. <strong>Python Service Co-location</strong>: The Python service must run alongside Node.js. <code>server.js</code> spawns the Python backend as a child process before starting the Express server.</p><p>3. <strong>Process Management</strong>: <code>server.js</code> ensures:<br>   - Python process is alive before Node.js begins accepting traffic<br>   - Graceful shutdown of Python when Node.js exits<br>   - Environment variables are propagated to both runtimes</p><h3>server.js Implementation Pattern</h3><pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">const { spawn } = require(&#039;child_process&#039;);\nconst express = require(&#039;express&#039;);\n\n// Start Python backend\nconst python = spawn(&#039;python3&#039;, [&#039;backend/main.py&#039;], {\n  env: { ...process.env, PORT: process.env.PYTHON_PORT || 5000 }\n});\n\npython.stdout.on(&#039;data&#039;, (data) =&gt; console.log(`[Python] ${data}`));\npython.stderr.on(&#039;data&#039;, (data) =&gt; console.error(`[Python] ${data}`));\n\n// Start Node.js frontend server\nconst app = express();\napp.use(express.json());\n\napp.get(&#039;/health&#039;, (req, res) =&gt; res.json({ status: &#039;ok&#039;, node: &#039;up&#039;, python: &#039;up&#039; }));\n\nconst server = app.listen(process.env.PORT || 8080, () =&gt; {\n  console.log(`Node.js server listening on ${process.env.PORT}`);\n});</code></pre><h2>Buildpack Execution Order</h2><div class=\"docs-diagram\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1100 680\" width=\"100%\" height=\"auto\"> <defs> <linearGradient id=\"grad-manifest\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#eff6ff\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#dbeafe\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-deploy\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fff7ed\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#ffedd5\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-staging\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f0fdf4\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#dcfce7\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-droplet\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f3e5f5\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#e1bee7\" /> </linearGradient> <linearGradient id=\"grad-running\" x1=\"0%\" y1=\"0%\" x2=\"100%\" y2=\"100%\"> <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#fdf2f8\" /> <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#fce7f3\" /> </linearGradient> <filter id=\"shadow\" x=\"-8%\" y=\"-8%\" width=\"116%\" height=\"116%\"> <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"6\" flood-color=\"rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08)\" /> </filter> <marker id=\"arr-blue\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#2563eb\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-amber\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#d97706\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-purple\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#9333ea\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-pink\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#db2777\" /> </marker> <marker id=\"arr-green\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M1,1 L7,4 L1,7 Z\" fill=\"#16a34a\" /> </marker> <style> .node-card { rx: 12; ry: 12; stroke-width: 1.5; filter: url(#shadow); } .txt-hdr { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: #0f172a; } .txt-lbl { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500; fill: #334155; } .txt-sub { font-family: 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace; font-size: 10px; fill: #64748b; } .flow-path { stroke-dasharray: 6,4; animation: dash 1.6s linear infinite; } @keyframes dash { to { stroke-dashoffset: -20; } } .chip { rx: 4; ry: 4; fill: #ffffff; stroke-width: 1; } .chip-txt { font-family: Ubuntu, system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; } </style> </defs> <!-- Background --> <rect width=\"1100\" height=\"680\" fill=\"#ffffff\" rx=\"16\" /> <!-- Title --> <text x=\"550\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"19\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Cloud Foundry Multi-Buildpack Lifecycle</text> <text x=\"550\" y=\"56\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#64748b\">Sequential Staging • Dual Runtime Provisioning • Container Orchestration</text> <!-- Stage Cards Top Row --> <!-- 1. manifest.yml --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 85)\"> <rect width=\"180\" height=\"120\" fill=\"url(#grad-manifest)\" stroke=\"#bfdbfe\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">1. manifest.yml</text> <text x=\"90\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Buildpack Spec</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"66\" width=\"150\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">1. python_buildpack</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"94\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#93c5fd\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">2. nodejs_buildpack</text> </g> <!-- 2. CF Staging --> <g transform=\"translate(250, 85)\"> <rect width=\"180\" height=\"120\" fill=\"url(#grad-deploy)\" stroke=\"#fed7aa\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">2. CF Staging Engine</text> <text x=\"90\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Diego Cell Stager</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"66\" width=\"150\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Uploads Source Artifact</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"94\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#fdba74\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Resolves Buildpacks</text> </g> <!-- 3. Dual Staging --> <g transform=\"translate(470, 85)\"> <rect width=\"180\" height=\"120\" fill=\"url(#grad-staging)\" stroke=\"#86efac\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">3. Sequential Build</text> <text x=\"90\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Provision Runtimes</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"66\" width=\"150\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#86efac\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">pip install requirements</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"94\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#86efac\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">npm install packages</text> </g> <!-- 4. Droplet --> <g transform=\"translate(690, 85)\"> <rect width=\"180\" height=\"120\" fill=\"url(#grad-droplet)\" stroke=\"#d8b4fe\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">4. Droplet Ready</text> <text x=\"90\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Container Layer</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"66\" width=\"150\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Python 3 + Node.js LTS</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"94\" width=\"150\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#c084fc\" /> <text x=\"90\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Source + server.js</text> </g> <!-- 5. Running Container --> <g transform=\"translate(900, 85)\"> <rect width=\"170\" height=\"120\" fill=\"url(#grad-running)\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" class=\"node-card\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"30\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-hdr\">5. App Running</text> <text x=\"85\" y=\"50\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-lbl\">Live Runtimes</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"66\" width=\"140\" height=\"24\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"82\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">npm start (server.js)</text> <rect x=\"15\" y=\"94\" width=\"140\" height=\"20\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"#f472b6\" /> <text x=\"85\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"txt-sub\">Spawns python worker</text> </g> <!-- Connectors Between Top Cards (Y=145) --> <path d=\"M 210,145 L 250,145\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-blue)\" /> <path d=\"M 430,145 L 470,145\" stroke=\"#d97706\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-amber)\" /> <path d=\"M 650,145 L 690,145\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-green)\" /> <path d=\"M 870,145 L 900,145\" stroke=\"#9333ea\" stroke-width=\"2\" class=\"flow-path\" marker-end=\"url(#arr-purple)\" /> <!-- Detailed Table (Bottom) --> <g transform=\"translate(30, 250)\"> <rect width=\"1040\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" stroke=\"#e2e8f0\" rx=\"14\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\" /> <rect width=\"1040\" height=\"42\" fill=\"#f1f5f9\" rx=\"14\" /> <text x=\"520\" y=\"26\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Step-by-Step Staging &amp; Orchestration Matrix</text> <!-- Row 1 --> <g transform=\"translate(40, 60)\"> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#2563eb\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">1</text> <text x=\"40\" y=\"19\" class=\"txt-lbl\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Manifest Configuration:</tspan> Cloud Foundry reads manifest.yml containing the buildpacks list array.</text> </g> <!-- Row 2 --> <g transform=\"translate(40, 110)\"> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#d97706\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">2</text> <text x=\"40\" y=\"19\" class=\"txt-lbl\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Source Upload:</tspan> cf push packages application source code, package.json, and python scripts.</text> </g> <!-- Row 3 --> <g transform=\"translate(40, 160)\"> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#16a34a\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">3</text> <text x=\"40\" y=\"19\" class=\"txt-lbl\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Python Buildpack Phase:</tspan> Installs Python interpreter and installs dependencies from requirements.txt.</text> </g> <!-- Row 4 --> <g transform=\"translate(40, 210)\"> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#16a34a\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">4</text> <text x=\"40\" y=\"19\" class=\"txt-lbl\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Node.js Buildpack Phase:</tspan> Installs Node.js runtime and executes npm install for @sap/cds packages.</text> </g> <!-- Row 5 --> <g transform=\"translate(40, 260)\"> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#9333ea\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">5</text> <text x=\"40\" y=\"19\" class=\"txt-lbl\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Droplet Assembly:</tspan> Staging engine bundles both runtime layers into a unified container image.</text> </g> <!-- Row 6 --> <g transform=\"translate(40, 310)\"> <circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"15\" r=\"12\" fill=\"#db2777\" /> <text x=\"15\" y=\"19\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Ubuntu, sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#ffffff\">6</text> <text x=\"40\" y=\"19\" class=\"txt-lbl\"><tspan font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#0f172a\">Runtime Orchestration:</tspan> Container launches npm start -> srv/python.js lazily spawns python worker.</text> </g> </g></svg></div><h2>Health Checks</h2><pre><code class=\"language-json\">{\n  &quot;nodejs_health&quot;: {\n    &quot;endpoint&quot;: &quot;/health&quot;,\n    &quot;expects&quot;: &quot;200 OK&quot;\n  },\n  &quot;python_health&quot;: {\n    &quot;endpoint&quot;: &quot;/api/health&quot;,\n    &quot;expects&quot;: &quot;200 OK&quot;\n  }\n}</code></pre><br></p>","tags":["buildpacks"],"details":""}